---
title: Restaurant MAS — Architecture
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as REST API (FastAPI)
    participant Orch as Orchestrator (Python)
    participant NATS
    participant OA as Order Agent (Go)
    participant TA as Table Agent (Go+Redis)
    participant KA as Kitchen Agent ×2 (Go+Redis)
    participant DA as Delivery Agent (Go+Redis)
    participant Redis
    participant Jaeger

    Client->>API: POST /orders {items, table}
    API->>Orch: process_order(payload)

    Note over Orch: Step 1 — Validate
    Orch->>NATS: publish tasks.process {type=validate_order}
    NATS->>OA: deliver (QueueGroup order-agents)
    OA->>OA: validateOrder()
    OA->>NATS: publish tasks.completed {success=true}
    NATS->>Orch: result → Future resolved

    Note over Orch: Step 2 — Assign Table
    Orch->>NATS: publish tasks.process {type=assign_table}
    NATS->>TA: deliver
    TA->>Redis: SET table:occupied:N order_id
    TA->>NATS: publish tasks.completed
    NATS->>Orch: result

    Note over Orch: Step 3 — Cook
    Orch->>NATS: publish tasks.process {type=cook_dish}
    NATS->>KA: deliver (QueueGroup kitchen-agents, load balanced)
    KA->>Redis: HSET kitchen:order:{id} status=cooking
    KA->>KA: simulate cook time
    KA->>Redis: HSET status=ready
    KA->>NATS: publish tasks.completed
    NATS->>Orch: result

    Note over Orch: Step 4 — Deliver
    Orch->>NATS: publish tasks.process {type=deliver_order}
    NATS->>DA: deliver
    DA->>Redis: HSET order:status:{id} delivered
    DA->>Redis: PUBLISH restaurant:events order.delivered
    DA->>NATS: publish tasks.completed
    NATS->>Orch: result

    Orch->>Redis: HSET order:status:{id} delivered
    Orch-->>API: {status: delivered, total, delivered_at}
    API-->>Client: 201 OrderResponse

    Note over OA,DA: All agents send OTLP spans
    OA-->>Jaeger: spans
    KA-->>Jaeger: spans
    Orch-->>Jaeger: root span
